## DEFERRED — golden rule, leave a note not a guess
Live DPS / combat memory reading (CodeStage [ACTk] ban risk); per-act gold/hr & clear-time (need memory); Steam Market
value (Inventory Service throttled/empty this build); 12-min blue-chest timer (no 720s in DropCooldown); stage-box drop
contents (ItemGroup GroupNames Korean); hero XP-to-next/ETA (no level curve in the tables). Unconfirmed aggregate
counters shown only if calibrated; otherwise omitted.

## GOLDEN RULE
An additional helper, never game-breaking. Read-only always (CodeStage [ACTk] anti-cheat). No fabricated data — every
label calibrated from the game's own tables/localization; honest fallback or omit. Verify EVERY change vs the LIVE save
(Node + headless browser, all 7 tabs, 0 console errors). QoL only.

## CONFIDENCE 9/10
All new data calibrated against the live save + Player.log (Codex owned-markers reconcile exactly; drop chain resolves
